# TF2's Spy disguise (specs/tf2/batch3_mechanics.md 5): a Spy target (his
# revolver) 6 m away, then the same target disguised as a Heavy: his
# enemies see the Heavy's body and minigun (`tf2:disguise ... targets`).
#   CHIMERA_ASSET_STORE=<store> cargo run --features dev --bin ultimate_gun_game -- --offscreen 1600x900 +volume 0 +sandbox \
#       --scene apps/ultimate_gun_game/scenes/tf2_disguise.scene --out <dir>
wait_for map_loaded 6000
wait_for spawned 3000
wait 120
god
rung tf2:tf_weapon_scattergun
target add tf2:tf_weapon_revolver 6
wait 2
wait_for idle 3000
wait 120
target look 1
wait 10
shot spy_plain
tf2:disguise heavy 2 targets
wait 200
wait 2
wait_for idle 3000
wait 60
target look 1
wait 10
shot spy_disguised
